<div class="boxed-content">
<p style="text-align: center;">Paid for by Peace Officers Research Association of California Political Action Committee (PORAC PAC). Not authorized by a candidate or a committee controlled by a candidate.</p>
<p>The below interactive guide allows you to view PORAC’s endorsed candidates representing your community at the local, state and federal level.</p>
<p>PORAC has a rigorous endorsement process that includes written surveys and in-person interviews, and our organization only endorses the most qualified candidates who have the expertise, vision and pragmatism to best serve our California communities.</p>
<p>PORAC’s endorsed candidates are committed to improving public safety, expanding important labor protections and advancing policies on behalf of our profession. Type your address below to see who PORAC has endorsed on your ballot and be sure to support these candidates with your vote!</p>
